{"id":1633,"name":"Kuromajo-san ga Tooru!!","slug":"kuromajo_san_ga_tooru","synopsis":"Kurotori Chiyoko, a 5th-grader in elementary school, loves the occult. One day, a friend requests her to do a love fortune-telling. Chiyoko tries to summon Cupid, but thanks to a stuffy nose, accidentally summons a witch named Gyubid instead!\n\nFrom that day on, Chiyoko starts learning witchcraft from Gyubid, the self-proclaimed hottest instructor of the magic world. The training regimen is tough, and punishment for slacking is harsh. Fortunately, Chiyoko is able to keep her extra-curricular studies secret, aided by the fact that no one else can see Gyubid.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo.com)","format":"TV_SHORT","season":"SPRING","year":2012,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:08","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 04:34:42","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":13159},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":13159},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":6895},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":9020},{"site":"ANN","externalId":14118},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":4904}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3257,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/0WPZXq79LRl02OZC0DBiylpVOYnC6fs1mV2Xh4Nv.jpg"},{"id":3258,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/8SYb6qrMA1GDsnpdo4i4xutfqnmtrbYyPuBKNsz1.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":70,"name":"Shin-Ei Animation","slug":"shin_ei_animation"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":4725,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":4725,"title":"Doki Doki Shichau no Oh Yeah!","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":5397,"version":1,"episodes":"1-32","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":4126,"basename":"KuromajoSanGaTooru-OP1.webm","filename":"KuromajoSanGaTooru-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/KuromajoSanGaTooru-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":11863153,"resolution":480,"nc":true,"subbed":false,"lyrics":false,"overlap":"NONE","source":"DVD","tags":"NCDVD480","audio":{"id":3758,"basename":"KuromajoSanGaTooru-OP1.ogg","filename"